# Third-party dictionaries, not part of the app:
# 雅思真题例句词典 -> scripts/atlas/import_ielts.py, OALDPEX -> import_syllables.py
# 词源词典 -> scripts/etymology/import_etymology.py; only the parse
# (scripts/etymology/etymology.json) ships, the 51 MB MDX itself does not
# ECCEDICT -> scripts/atlas/import_ecdict.py; only the a-z fallback shards ship
/雅思真题例句词典
/OALDPEX
/etymology/
/同义词学习词典/
/ECCEDICT/

# Word pronunciations: the ElevenLabs takes ship with the repo, the OALDPEX
# replacements do not.
# - public/atlas/audio/{uk,us}: first reading, ~161 MB
# - public/atlas/audio/{uk2,us2}: second reading of the 14 heteronyms
# - private/audio/oaldpex/*: OALDPEX (OUP), private build only — never commit
/private/
/.workbuddy

# Python bytecode from local checks
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local build scratch and superpowers ledger
.tmp-build/
.superpowers/
